      "writtenOn": "2020-10-22T11:09:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Why is a duplicate report a problem? An app that assumes that one call to reportNetworkConnectivity will generate exactly one report is making an incorrect assumption. For example, another app might have called reportNetworkConnectivity at around the same time.",
